        <briefdescription>
<para>Whether conflicts are watched for. Off until a <ref refid="classecss_1_1Registry" kindref="compound">Registry</ref> turns it on. @thread_safety Internally synchronized. One relaxed load, which is a plain move on every architecture that matters. Atomic rather than a bare bool because every tracked call reads it while <ref refid="classecss_1_1detail_1_1AccessTracker_1a037b0eabe2f872c70f5ecefe2e48a597" kindref="member">setEnabled()</ref> may be writing, and a torn read there would be a data race in the tool meant to find them. </para>
        </briefdescription>
