        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>One record per component type, for the life of the process. Types are numbered from a single counter, so a plain map keyed by that number is enough and never rehashes under a reader. @thread_safety Internally synchronized. Takes the table mutex. The map is keyed by a dense type id and lives for the process, so entries are never removed. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
